  "slides": [
    {
      "type": "cover",
      "main": "No one believed in the DJ.",
      "sub": "No name. No credit. No stage. And yet everything started there."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "1935.",
        "A radio announcer played a record.",
        "Not a performer.",
        "Not a composer.",
        "So he got no credit."
      ],
      "sub": "The first DJ had no name."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "1969. New York.",
        "Francis Grasso.",
        "He put on headphones",
        "and matched beat to beat.",
        "The silence between songs",
        "disappeared that night."
      ],
      "sub": "The first beatmix."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "1973. The Bronx.",
        "Kool Herc.",
        "A man from Jamaica.",
        "Two copies of the same record.",
        "The breakbeat — extended forever.",
        "The origin of hip-hop.",
        "The origin of all DJ technique."
      ],
      "sub": "Everything traces back here."
    },
    {
      "type": "quote",
      "quote": [
        "It wasn't religion.",
        "It was something deeper.",
        "A place for the soul."
      ],
      "note": "On Frankie Knuckles' Warehouse, Chicago 1977 — the root of house music"
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "UK rave.",
        "The DJ was in the dark.",
        "No face. No name.",
        "Twenty thousand people",
        "followed the sound."
      ],
      "sub": "The music was enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "The 90s made DJs into stars.",
        "Then the next generation hid their faces again.",
        "Burial never appeared.",
        "Daft Punk wore helmets.",
        "If the sound speaks,",
        "you don't need a face."
      ],
      "sub": "The anonymous ones carried it further."
    },
    {
      "type": "cta",
      "text": [
        "If the sound speaks,",
        "no name is needed.",
        "But there are things",
        "worth leaving behind."
      ],
      "strobe": "1935 → 1969 → 1973 → 1977",
      "cta": "Save this. You'll want to read it again."
    }
  ]
